    "title": "Saturday SCORCHER on the way! - NewsBreak",
    "text": "Get ready for a serious dose of some summertime heat and humidity this weekend! We are under an Extreme Heat Watch for Saturday and Sunday, this could easily be extended through Monday and Tuesday too. The combination of heat and humidity will make it fell like it’s about 105° Saturday afternoon! Sunday looks just as hot… Actual high temps this weekend will be around 95° but the humidity will make it fell much worse. For the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to WHBF - OurQuadCities.com.",
